    m_Localized: BUILD TIME {0}s
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548765
    m_Localized: '{0} cards remain. Pick the unfinished choices at random and start the next wave?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548766
    m_Localized: SLOT {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548767
    m_Localized: REPLACE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548768
    m_Localized: FROZEN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548769
    m_Localized: PARALYSED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548770
    m_Localized: ICE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548771
    m_Localized: STUN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548772
    m_Localized: VOID PORTAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548773
    m_Localized: "E \xB7 ENTER\nFAILURE ENDS RUN\nCLEARS STATUS & SHIELD"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548774
    m_Localized: '{0} WAVES LEFT'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548775
    m_Localized: "VOID \xB7 {0} WAVES"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548776
    m_Localized: BLACK HOLE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548777
    m_Localized: ELITE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548778
    m_Localized: "SHADE INCOMING"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548779
    m_Localized: GREATER VOID REWARD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548780
    m_Localized: "Pick one of three Greater Void skills (or none); they have no further levels. 1 / 2 / 3 select."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548781
    m_Localized: DRAFT {0} / {1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548782
    m_Localized: Survive the warp. Master every anomaly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548783
    m_Localized: "Pick one familiar form. Which backfire it has is unknown until you take it; the moment you choose, the game pauses and the weapon card appears.\nAim manually; use the terrain."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548784
    m_Localized: "Pick one of three: a new weapon, or a higher Mk of one you hold (weapons grow stronger through higher Mks from the armory). You may skip. Upgrades stay with the weapon: replace it and they are gone with it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548785
    m_Localized: "Three cards, one of each: a stat card, a weapon card (an upgrade direction a revealed weapon has not taken yet) and a skill card (a new skill, or one level for a skill you own). 1 / 2 / 3 select; R rerolls (once per build phase)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548786
    m_Localized: "Choose the weapon to replace. Upgrades stay with the weapon: replace it and they are gone with it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548787
    m_Localized: "With 3 skills already, taking a new one means replacing an old one; the new skill starts at level 1."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548788
    m_Localized: "Build choices complete. Click START NEXT WAVE to go on."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548789
    m_Localized: The battlefield and the build clock are paused.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548790
    m_Localized: RUN ENDED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548791
    m_Localized: EARTH IS WITHIN REACH
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548792
    m_Localized: EXPLORER LOST
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548793
    m_Localized: "Wave {0} \xB7 Level {1} \xB7 {2} kills\n{3} seconds on the Interstellar Battlefield"
