  - m_Id: 818548946
    m_Localized: English (Showcase)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548947
    m_Localized: GREATER VOID REWARD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548948
    m_Localized: DRAFT {0} / {1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548949
    m_Localized: 'REROLL [{0}]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548950
    m_Localized: Fully charged shots can bounce off walls up to 2 times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548951
    m_Localized: "Charging no longer slows you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548952
    m_Localized: Reverse shots can bounce off walls 3 times instead of 1.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548953
    m_Localized: Reverse rounds turn toward your aim 0.3 s after leaving.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548954
    m_Localized: The throwing knife can bounce off walls up to 2 times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548955
    m_Localized: The straight return after a kill no longer hurts you; it still cuts enemies on the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548956
    m_Localized: A hook that hits a wall moves you to the wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548957
    m_Localized: The flung enemy is stunned for 1.5 seconds when it lands.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548958
    m_Localized: The explosion pulls characters toward its centre instead of knocking them outward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548959
    m_Localized: Your explosion no longer damages you, but still displaces you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548960
    m_Localized: Ending the flight on open ground pushes enemies within radius 3 outward by 8 units.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548961
    m_Localized: Hitting a wall no longer damages you; you still bounce back 3 units.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548962
    m_Localized: Push enemies out by 3 when the pull ends; no extra damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548963
    m_Localized: Your attraction field no longer pulls you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548964
    m_Localized: Repel only in the aimed 180-degree half circle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548965
    m_Localized: Remove your 2-unit recoil; orbs are still repelled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548966
    m_Localized: Push side targets toward the aim line; push centred targets forward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548967
    m_Localized: Reloading never jams.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548968
    m_Localized: Focused pellets pierce the first target; later targets take 60%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548969
    m_Localized: The release recoil becomes a push that never causes wall damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548970
    m_Localized: Pierce the first body and swap with the second valid target; hit each once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548971
    m_Localized: Gain 0.5 s hit protection after a swap; no status clear or hole immunity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548972
    m_Localized: Blast at departure too; overlapping blasts hit each enemy once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548973
    m_Localized: Recall the unused planted dagger after 6 s, without teleporting or exploding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548974
    m_Localized: Click again after 0.3 s attached to detonate early.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548975
    m_Localized: Attached carriers no longer speed up; the blast can still hurt you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548976
    m_Localized: Stick to the wall after the third bounce, keeping the original fuse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548977
    m_Localized: The blast spares your HP but still displaces you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548978
    m_Localized: Reflect the flame once at the first wall; hit each body once per shot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548979
    m_Localized: Overheat adds no Fire to you; the 1.5 s lockout stays.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548980
    m_Localized: Push out by 3 when a fire patch ends; no extra damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548981
    m_Localized: Your own fire patches no longer burn you; other fire still can.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548982
    m_Localized: 'Frozen bodies can chain-shatter: at most 3 bursts, each body once.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548983
    m_Localized: Wall shards no longer apply Frost to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548984
    m_Localized: Cloud stays for 2 s after release; only one cloud at a time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548985
    m_Localized: Spraying no longer slows you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548986
    m_Localized: Later jumps prefer the most Lightning stacks, then the nearest target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548987
    m_Localized: Empty jumps end without damaging you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548988
    m_Localized: 'Knockback and thrown travel also charge: 1 per unit, cap 30.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548989
    m_Localized: After 4 s full, drain 1 charge/s instead of self-blasting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548990
    m_Localized: Cloud drifts 1 unit/s along its launch direction, blocked by walls and bounds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548991
    m_Localized: Your clouds do not hurt or poison you; other poison still can.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548992
    m_Localized: Needles bounce once off a wall; no body piercing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548993
    m_Localized: Firing no longer costs you HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548994
    m_Localized: Pierce one interior wall, never bounds; body damage still decays.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548995
    m_Localized: Still move back by 4, using a push without wall-impact damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548996
    m_Localized: On a kill, fire one half-damage follow-up within 4; no execute, kill bonus or repeat follow-up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548997
    m_Localized: Executions no longer lower your max HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548998
    m_Localized: Keep spin-up for 1 s after release; release still restores movement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818548999
    m_Localized: Keep 70% movement at full heat; firing speed is unchanged.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818549000
    m_Localized: Enemy blast becomes a forward 90-degree cone; self-damage and lockout remain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818549001
    m_Localized: Overheat spares your HP; the 3 s lockout remains.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818549002
    m_Localized: Wall hit leaves a 1 s mine; blast if an enemy enters 1.5, without making new mines.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818549003
    m_Localized: Rockets never hurt you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818549004
    m_Localized: Reverse the six blasts from far to near; other values stay the same.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818549005
    m_Localized: Bombard blasts spare your HP but still displace you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818549006
    m_Localized: "Portal open: stand on it and press E to enter the Void Trial"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 818549007
    m_Localized: TIME HELD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
